        "# Statistical Modeling {data-stack-name=\"Modeling\" .text-70 .crunch-title}\n",
        "\n",
        "So far:\n",
        "\n",
        "<i class='bi bi-1-circle'></i> Our models need to accommodate **irreducible** error (error inherent to DGP)\n",
        "\n",
        "<i class='bi bi-2-circle'></i> Our models need to **penalize complexity**, to prevent Yes Man from just \"memorizing\" training data\n",
        "\n",
        "<i class='bi bi-3-circle'></i> ...But, if we penalize **too harshly**, we lose the ability to model nonlinearity!\n",
        "\n",
        "Let's dive a bit more into <i class='bi bi-2-circle'></i>, via one of my fav examples from the history of science 🤓\n",
        "\n",
        "## Scientific Models {.smaller .crunch-title .title-12 .crunch-quarto-figure}\n",
        "\n",
        ":::: {layout=\"[1,2]\" layout-valign=\"center\"}\n",
